# Frontend accessibility

- Semantic landmarks (`header`, `main`, `nav`, `table`).
- Visible focus rings; do not remove outlines.
- Associate every input with a label (`htmlFor` / `aria-label`).
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Admin and review tables are dense but keyboard reachable.
- Do not ship toast-only errors; keep a textual status region.
